44
00:03:41,012 --> 00:03:43,223
Kita tak bisa hidup bahagia sendirian.

45
00:03:43,306 --> 00:03:46,392
Bagaimana kita mencarinya?
Kau tahu sesuatu mengenai dia?

46
00:03:46,476 --> 00:03:47,518
Tidak.

47
00:03:47,602 --> 00:03:48,561
Apa kau tahu, Na-mu?

48
00:03:49,145 --> 00:03:50,605
Hei, bagaimana aku…

49
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:57,987
Tidak! Aku tak tahu apa-apa.

50
