- Nyalakan lampu!

66
00:07:25,903 --> 00:07:26,988
Halo, Bu.

67
00:07:40,501 --> 00:07:41,461
Pamanmu…

68
00:07:42,253 --> 00:07:43,212
akan datang ke sini.

69
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,840
Kau serius?

70
00:07:46,424 --> 00:07:49,760
Jika kau berbohong, kau akan masuk neraka
dan makan 3.000 jarum sehari.

71
00:07:49,844 --> 00:07:51,179
Aku membacanya di buku.

72
00:07:52,889 --> 00:07:53,723
Sungguh.

73
00:07:55,475 --> 00:07:57,351
Apa kau teman pamanku?

74
00:07:59,312 --> 00:08:00,563
Bisa dibilang begitu.

75
00:08:07,487 --> 00:08:09,113
Kurasa dia sudah tiba.

76
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:12,325
Jadi, aku…

77
00:08:14,118 --> 00:08:15,661
tak perlu makan jarum, 'kan?

78
00:08:23,711 --> 00:08:24,545
Paman.

79
00:08:25,087 --> 00:08:26,255
Dasar bajingan!

80
00:08:34,055 --> 00:08:35,056
Biarkan dia.

81
00:08:36,265 --> 00:08:37,558
Paman!

82
00:08:38,309 --> 00:08:39,185
Geu-ru.

83
00:08:40,895 --> 00:08:41,896
Geu-ru.

84
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:45,066
- Kau tak apa-apa?
- Aku tak apa-apa.

85
00:08:46,234 --> 00:08:48,110
- Apa-apaan ini?
- Paman.

86
00:08:49,946 --> 00:08:51,155
Jangan marah.

87
00:08:51,239 --> 00:08:54,325
Temanmu bukan orang jahat.

88
00:08:59,997 --> 00:09:02,959
Kau sungguh berniat untuk memutus hubungan
dan menghilang?

89
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:07,213
Aku tak tahu bahwa Cho Sang-gu

90
00:09:08,422 --> 00:09:09,507
